id: super-demon-demon-realm-elite
name: Demon Realm Elite
order: 3
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: demonic-traits
groupLabel: Demonic Traits
description: >
  As one of the strongest in the Demon Realm, when you unleash your full power, entire worlds tremble in fear.
text: >
  Demon Realm Elite: As one of the strongest in the Demon Realm, when you unleash your full power, entire worlds tremble in fear.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: You are of the Demon Person Subrace.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Combat Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T) while an Opponent is suffering from a Combat Condition that you inflicted.
  (3)-[1/Round]: You may spend stacks of Demonic Power as if they were Actions/Counter Actions for the Action Cost of your Magical Unique Abilities that have an Action Cost of 1 Action/Counter Action.
  (4)-[Choice]: Depending on your choice for the 3rd effect of Denizen of the Demon Realm, apply the following effects:
  Demon Warrior [Passive]: Increase the Strike and Wound Rolls of your Armed Attacks by 1(T).
  Demon Mage [Passive]: Increase the Strike and Wound Rolls of your Magic Attacks by 1(T).
  Demon Face [Passive]: Super Demon gains an Attribute Modifier Bonus (SC/PE) equal to its Attribute Modifier Bonus (MA).
  Elemental Demon [Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of your Favored Elements by 2(T).
  Gigantic Demon [Passive]: Increase the Dice Category of your Punching Down Extra Dice by 1 Dice Category.
  Transforming Demon [Passive]: Increase the Attribute Modifier Bonus (FO/MA) of Super Demon by 1(T).

---

